EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Sorry about this mess!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
It must be a shock {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}to see my place
such a disaster.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} But I'm moving!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I wanted to tell you earlier,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} but I
just couldn't find{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} the right time.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0018:}}
I knew you'd be heartbroken!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Thanks so much for everything!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You've been,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} like, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}an awesome pal.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Stay real, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Scusa questo caos da paura!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
No, non mi hanno svaligiato la casa.{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Sto solo traslocando!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Avrei voluto dirtelo prima, ma
non amo molto gli addii.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0018:}} Mi dispiace
se ti ho spezzato il cuore!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Grazie una cifra per tutto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sei stat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} {{TAG:000E:0006:100075006E00200061006D00690063006F00100075006E00270061006D00690063006100}} troppo forte!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Stammi benone, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Bu dağınıklık için kusura bakma!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Evimi böyle darmadağın{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} görmek seni şoke
etmiştir.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} Ama taşınıyorum!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Sana daha önce söylemek istedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
ama bir türlü{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} doğru zamanı bulamadım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0018:}}
Çok üzüleceğini biliyordum!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Her şey için çook teşekkür ederim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sen,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} şey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}harika bir arkadaştın.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Kendin ol, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}ho visite!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ciaaao, piacere di conoscerti!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Io sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Non ti affezionare troppo, però.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Sto per traslocare in un'altra città!{{TAG:0003:0020:}}
Beh, ci vediamo chissà dove!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Che idea spaziale! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}Dici sul serio?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}È una decisione superimportante!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Dovrò pensarci un po' su{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}OK, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}ci ho pensato! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Mi trasferisco
nella tua città!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Adoro decidere così,
su due zampe, come nei film!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Beh, finisco di preparare tutto!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Grazie del consiglio,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ci sentiamo dopo il trasloco!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sul serio? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Beh, forse dovrei dare
un'occhiata alla tua città,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Come si chiama?
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0006:}}, eh? {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}Mi piace un sacco!
Suona bene! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Deve essere stato
il destino a farci conoscere!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}OK! Ho deciso!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Mi trasferirò {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0006:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
Non vedo l'ora! {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sarà galattico!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}nereye taşındığımı{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} söylemeyi
unuttum! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}diye şirin bir kasaba!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Beni ziyaret etsen iyi olur!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Mir ist gerade was aufgegangen!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Nächstes Mal, wenn wir uns treffen,
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}wohnen wir ja beide in {{TAG:0005:0006:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Bir şey fark ettim! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}Bir dahaki
görüşmemizde,{{TAG:0003:001D:}} {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}sen de {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}ben de {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0006:}}
kasabasının sakini olacağız!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm totally {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}going to miss this town.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
But my star is too bright{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}} to keep it
locked up {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}in just one place!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Now I just need to find {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}another
amazing place {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}that'll let me sparkle.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Any great ideas, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
How about MY town?
Uh...nope.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Questa città mi mancherà un sacco!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ma un talento come il mio può
fiorire solo in una città più trendy!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}L'unico problema è che non saprei
proprio dove trasferirmi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Tu hai qualche idea, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Vieni nella mia città!
Ehm... no.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bu kasabayı {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}kesinlikle özleyeceğim.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Ama yıldızım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}} tek bir yerde{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} kapalı
kalamayacak kadar parlak!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Şimdi tek yapmam gereken {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}parlamama izin
verecek {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}başka harika bir yer bulmak.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Harika bir fikrin var mı, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
BENİM kasabam nasıl?
Şey... yok.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Je, je! ¡No pasa nada, tranqui!{{TAG:0003:002C:}} 
Alguno encontraré, es solo cuestión
de buscar.

IT:
